// Tessera stdlib: tables and double-double helpers shared by the F64 sinh, cosh and tanh
//
// exp(x) is reduced as x = (2^12 ie + 2^6 i0 + i1) log(2) / 2^12 + dx, with 2^(i0/64) and 2^(i1/2^12) from
// two 64-entry double-double tables and exp(dx) from a short polynomial. The accurate path evaluates a longer
// polynomial in double-double arithmetic (cm_f64_hyp_exp_accurate).
//
// Ported from CORE-MATH, src/binary64/sinh/sinh.c and src/binary64/cosh/cosh.c (which carry identical copies
// of these helpers and tables) via RazorForge's B64HypShared.rf.
// Copyright (c) 2023-2026 Alexei Sibidanov and Paul Zimmermann
// Copyright (c) 2023-2025 Alexei Sibidanov <sibid@uvic.ca>
// MIT license: see LICENSE-CORE-MATH

module Standard::Core

